*Solution Steps Walkthrough:*

1. Define $f(z) = 2(z - 1)^17$ and $g(z) = - e^(-z)$.
2. Compute $|f(z)| = 2$ on the circle $|z - 1| = 1$.
3. Find the maximum of $|g(z)| = e^(-"Re"(z))$ on $|z - 1| = 1$.
4. Verify the strict inequality $|f(z)| > |g(z)|$.
5. Count the zeros of $f(z)$ inside the disk.
